# Replace guidance with factual content; do not commit placeholder text.
# Subject: type(scope): imperative summary (aim for 72 characters or fewer)
# Brief summary: explain what changed and why.
#
# Changes:
# - Describe meaningful scope, behavior, or decisions.
#
# Verification:
# - Name checks actually performed and their results.
# - Attribute prior owner-reported evidence; state material unverified limits.
#
# Impact: include compatibility, risks, or operational effects when relevant.
#
# Refs: IMP-### (replace with a real applicable ID, or omit)
#
# Keep trivial changes concise; expand architectural/security/build changes.
# Remove unused sections. See docs/DEVELOPMENT-WORKFLOW.md for details.
# Comment-only content is guidance, not a commit message; write your own text.
